# Push verification (before `git push`)

**Canonical (Claude · Codex · Cursor):** [`scripts/agent-gates/README.md`](../../scripts/agent-gates/README.md) + root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Checks.  
This file is a Cursor on-demand mirror — **do not invent a second policy here.**

When Will asks to **push** / **ship**:

1. **Do not** require `gate.sh build` / `next build` before push（已暂停，太慢）
2. Commit must already have passed lint+typecheck（`gate.sh check`）+ 清冗余 + UAT when required
3. Optional: targeted tests for touched logic (`node --import tsx --test …`) when justified — not a push hook
4. If the push includes `supabase/migrations/**`（or Will asks to push migrations to staging/cloud）: **first** apply pending migrations on local Docker — see [`local-db-before-push.mdc`](./local-db-before-push.mdc); do not push cloud while local tip lags the files
5. Then `git push origin main`（或指定分支）

**Still require build** before on-prem **pack/zip** when web inputs change — see `on-prem-pack.mdc`.
